flowchart LR
    subgraph Ref[Implemented Python reference slice]
        A[Python caller supplies response]
        B[Serialize complete response in memory]
        C{Payload meets byte threshold?}
        D[Small path: AdaptiveResponseFilter returns full result; filter_response yields one concat envelope]
        E{Large payload is JSON object?}
        F[Split top-level object members]
        G[Split valid UTF-8 at code-point boundaries]
        H[Create CRC32 envelopes with sequence, total, merge mode]
        I[Return full result or yield envelope objects and mappings]
        J[Per-message Reassembler validates CRC32, index, total, mode, and quotas]
        J1[Contract guard: total_chunks cannot change mid-message; duplicate identical frames are ignored; conflicting duplicates are rejected; one Reassembler handles one message; UTF-8 boundaries are preserved]
        K{All declared chunks received?}
        L[Merge complete JSON object fragments]
        M[Concatenate complete payload bytes]
        N[Return complete reconstructed bytes]
        O[Reject unsplittable element with UnsplittableValueError]
    end

    subgraph Future[Production integration not implemented here]
        P[HTTP writer or transport adapter]
        Q[Gateway and client decoder]
        R[Progressive user interface]
    end

    A --> B --> C
    C -->|Below threshold| D --> I
    C -->|At or above threshold| E
    E -->|Yes| F --> H
    E -->|No| G --> H
    F --> O
    G --> O
    H --> I --> J --> J1 --> K
    K -->|No, keep buffering| J
    K -->|Yes, json-object mode| L --> N
    K -->|Yes, concat mode| M --> N
    I -. envelope handoff requires an adapter .-> P
    P --> Q --> R
